      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/94ad74/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-11T03:28:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After some extensive playing and introduction to the game to new players (who loves it, btw), I seemed to have lost a card from the Insula Primalis environment deck somewhere because I only counted 14 cards in that deck. Been looking for it for the past few days and it never turned up. The problem is I have no idea what card is missing because I couldn't find any card list for environment decks. My current count of the deck consists of the following:</p>\n<p>3x Obsidian Field</p>\n<p>2x River of Lava</p>\n<p>2x Pterodactuyl Thief</p>\n<p>3x Velociraptor Pack</p>\n<p>2x Primordial Plant Life</p>\n<p>1x Volcanic Eruption</p>\n<p>1x Enraged T-Rex</p>\n<p>…14 cards  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\"></p>\n<p>Any help on identifying what card I'm missing from Primalis Insula so that I can probably order a replacement if it still doesn't turn up? Much appreciated!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:50.037Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
